    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Travel is a stylish and versatile WordPress Full Site Editing (FSE) theme, and a child theme of WENS Haelo, crafted specifically for travel agencies, tour operators, travel bloggers, and adventure seekers. With a clean, modern design and powerful features, WENS Travel makes it easy to build a professional and immersive online presence for any travel-related venture. Built for seamless integration with the WordPress Block Editor, this theme offers intuitive customization and flexible layout options. Highlight breathtaking destinations, promote curated tour packages, share engaging travel stories, or create a stunning portfolio — all designed to inspire exploration and connect with your audience. Whether you're launching a new travel brand or growing an existing one, WENS Travel helps you create a captivating digital experience that stands out."
    },
